OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F192A1769030963
OL,1,Vk4          j7   h4              G2/5
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~s j7*u?j?h7`s}GTELETEXT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5p juj5j5j5juGBIDDERS
OL,5, Those bidding for the ITV and Channel
OL,6, 4 Teletext franchise include:
OL,8, Oracle Teletext,Fholders of the current
OL,9,Ffranchise, have promised a number of
OL,10,Finnovations, including a new computer
OL,11,Fsystem to reduce the time it takes to
OL,12,Fput information on-screen.
OL,14,FIt would operate alongside a "Teletext
OL,15,Fready" worldwide news sevice from the
OL,16,FPress Association news agency but would
OL,17,Fretain editorial control.
OL,19,FOracle plans a network of regional news
OL,20,Fand road reports.
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG20-01-92
OL,23,D]FFLots more at:Gteletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFNat Radio
