CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F192A1769030963
OL,1,Vk4          j7   h4              G3/5
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~s j7*u?j?h7`s}GTELETEXT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5p juj5j5j5juGBIDDERS
OL,5, Those bidding for the ITV and Channel
OL,6, 4 Teletext franchise include:
OL,8, Update Teletext,Fpart of an ITN
OL,9,Fconsortium, proposes a "revolutionary
OL,10,Fnew approach" to attract new audiences
OL,11,Fand build on the news service it
OL,12,Fcurrently provides to Oracle.
OL,14,FIt proposes contrasting news services
OL,15,Ffor Channels 3 and 4.
OL,17,FThere would be 40 pages of local news
OL,18,Fand weather and a wider variety of
OL,19,Finterests catered for, including
OL,20,Fgardening, motoring and family issues.
OL,22,D] FThis Ceefax page is fromG20-01-92
OL,23,D] FLots more at:Gteletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFNat Radio
