PN,19204
SC,0004
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F192A1769030963
OL,1,Vk4          j7   h4              G4/5
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~s j7*u?j?h7`s}GTELETEXT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5p juj5j5j5juGBIDDERS
OL,5, Those bidding for the ITV and Channel
OL,6, 4 Teletext franchise include:
OL,8, Intelfax and Carlton Communications'
OL,9,Fservice would be called Gemini with
OL,10,F450 main pages and a total of 2,600
OL,11,Fpages across both channels, including
OL,12,Fregional services.
OL,14,FIt proposes to employ 115 people in
OL,15,FLondon, Leeds, Cardiff and Glasgow.
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG20-01-92
OL,23,D] FLots more at:Gteletextarchive.com
