OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F192A1769030963
OL,1,Vk4          j7   h4              G5/5
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~s j7*u?j?h7`s}GTELETEXT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5p juj5j5j5juGBIDDERS
OL,5, Those bidding for the ITV and Channel
OL,6, 4 Teletext franchise include:
OL,8, Teletext UKFproposes to use its
OL,9,Finvolvement with Philips, pioneers of
OL,10,Fteletext, to make what it claims would
OL,11,Fbe the most technically advanced
OL,12,Fservice in the world.
OL,14,FTheGTV-am Cable TelevisionFproposal
OL,15,Fincludes "multicultural pages" aimed at
OL,16,Fethnic communities in different parts
OL,17,Fof the country.
OL,19,FThe Press Association news service
OL,20,Fwould provide national and regional
OL,21,Fnews, sport, finance and business news.
